permanent closure of 66 Future Shop stores and the conversion of the remaining 65 Future Shop stores to the Best Buy brand. All restructuring charges related to
this plan are from continuing operations within our International segment and are presented in Restructuring charges on our Consolidated Statements of Earnings
for the fiscal years presented. We recorded a benefit of $1 million , a benefit of $2 million and charges of $3 million in fiscal 2019, fiscal 2018 and fiscal 2017,
respectively, related to facility closure and other costs. As of February 2, 2019, we had incurred cumulative charges of $200 million related to this plan.

